
Reset of the command rules of group 'engineer' to the shipped default
---------------------------------------------------------------------
  commands
    - reload       deny
    - copy         permit ^((running-config|startup-config|system:running-config|nvram:startup-config) (startup-config|nvram:startup-config|(flash|bootflash|harddisk|disk\d|usbflash\d*):\S*|(tftp|ftp|scp|sftp|http|https):\S*))( .*)?$
